.nh
.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-run - Run a one-off job (migration, seed) with a service's image, variables and secrets


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container run  --service  [flags] [-- COMMAND [ARG...]]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a command once with the image (pinned to the digest of the running version), variables and secrets of an
existing service, then stops. Everything after "--" is the command; it replaces the image ENTRYPOINT and is passed as
a list (no shell: write sh -c "a && b" for shell features). Without a command the image's own command runs.
--follow streams the output; --wait waits silently. With either, the CLI exits with the job's exit code
(124 = time limit reached, 130 = stopped). Free on node plans (uses your nodes); on Serverless the job is billed per
vCPU-second / GB-second like a task (billing line "-job"). Parallel jobs per environment are limited
(2-3 by plan); see "gyro limits".


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--cpu\fP=""
	vCPU for the job (default: same as the service)

.PP
\fB--follow\fP[=false]
	stream the output until the job ends (implies --wait)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for run

.PP
\fB--memory\fP=0
	memory in MB for the job (default: same as the service)

.PP
\fB--service\fP=""
	service whose image, variables and secrets are used (required)

.PP
\fB--time-limit\fP=0s
	stop the job after this time (10s-6h, default 30m)

.PP
\fB--wait\fP[=false]
	wait until the job ends; exit with its exit code


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--account\fP=""
	act in another account you are a panel user of (id from \fBgyro account list\fR; "self" = your own; env GYRO_ACCOUNT, profile default: \fBgyro account use\fR)

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gyro container run 17000 --service api --follow -- npm run migrate
  gyro container run 17000 --service web --wait --time-limit 10m -- sh -c "php artisan migrate --force && php artisan db:seed --force"
  gyro container run 17000 --service api --cpu 1 --memory 1024 -- python manage.py migrate
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro-container(1)\fP
